From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] MAINTAINERS: add the GalaChip GC1601 SoC

List the files of the GalaChip GC1601 support that are shared by all
boards with the SoC; each board lists its own in board/<vendor>/<board>.

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index 55c39453..41583023 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -323,6 +323,21 @@ F:	arch/arm/cpu/arm1136/mx*/
 F:	arch/arm/cpu/arm926ejs/mx*/
 F:	arch/arm/include/asm/arch-mx*/
 
+ARM GALACHIP
+M:	Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
+S:	Maintained
+F:	arch/arm/dts/gc1601*
+F:	arch/arm/include/asm/arch-galachip/
+F:	arch/arm/mach-galachip/
+F:	drivers/clk/clk-gc1601.c
+F:	drivers/net/gc1601_eth.c
+F:	drivers/net/gc1601_mdio.c
+F:	drivers/spi/ftspi020.c
+F:	drivers/timer/fttmr010_timer.c
+F:	include/configs/gc1601.h
+F:	include/dt-bindings/clock/galachip,gc1601-clock.h
+F:	include/env/galachip/
+
 ARM HISILICON
 M:	Peter Griffin <peter.griffin@linaro.org>
 M:	Manivannan Sadhasivam <manivannan.sadhasivam@linaro.org>
